{"title":"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_18\">Problem 18</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 18\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> with three digits in its base ten representation is chosen at random, \nwith each three digit number having an equal chance of being chosen. The probability that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/3/473fe4129af430403428216b96a7be8c1181ab07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2 N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" /> is an integer is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/9/a99e3cecf9cbc8210faa765014b202903eec8fe0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 3/899 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 1/225 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ 1/300 \\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ 1/450$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"496\" height=\"20\" /> \n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In order for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/3/473fe4129af430403428216b96a7be8c1181ab07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2 N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" /> to be an integer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> has to be an integer power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is a three-digit number in decimal form, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> can only be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/8/848b1b2c34d97589c19cf36deadc20d9e97fd06d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{7} = 128,\\ 2^{8} = 256,\\ \\text{or}\\ 2^{9} = 512$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"254\" height=\"20\" />. From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/0/0705411d92671faf1fe5602cfef8f353c7f0f83d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fdd4beaeec1aa15c400a0763d78937b0385924b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$900$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> three-digit numbers in total.\n</p><p>The probability of choosing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/e/0aed56990dedba5a88a65e21245ccfd5d5e43ae2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$128$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/d/abd678361b0f40ec2723283c0f2bab3df5cadc68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$256$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/c/e4c6bb7504dc877a30762bdce904c5b94c51fc60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$512$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fdd4beaeec1aa15c400a0763d78937b0385924b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$900$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c333e1cc899218ba92ed7057561f25bd0bd9b8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{900} = \\frac{1}{300}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"85\" height=\"37\" />, which gives us the answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/3/5a3dbb82e13f9cc19c417a1924cf10d49e526f4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 1/300}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"92\" height=\"29\" />. ~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Jiang147369\">jiang147369</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME\" title=\"1975 AHSME\">1975 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1975 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1975\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=